 html←plotHtml spec;json;body
⍝ HTML document for HTMLRenderer chart (Observable Plot + apache-arrow via CDN).
 json←plotSpecJson spec
 body←plotHtmlBody
 html←'<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>DuckDB Plot</title>'
 html,←'<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}'
 html,←'#plot{min-height:90vh;padding:8px}#status{padding:8px;color:#444}</style></head><body>'
 html,←'<div id="status">Waiting for data…</div><div id="plot"></div>'
 html,←'<script>window.__PLOT_SPEC__=',json,';</script>'
 html,←body
 html,←'</body></html>'
